    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present 42 Annaville Park to the market, a most attractive three-bedroom semi-detached family home quietly positioned in a highly sought-after residential setting. Despite being in move-in condition this home has been vacant for 2 years so eligible for the 'Vacant Property Grant from Dun Laoghaire / Rathdown Co Co. This exceptionally bright home is offered in turn-key, walk-in condition, boasting light-filled accommodation throughout thanks to its enviable southerly aspect.\n\nCarefully updated while retaining its timeless character, the home showcases numerous original features from its vintage design, including an authentic front door, high picture rails, a classic bay window, and elegant original flooring. On the ground floor, a warm reception room opens off the hallway, leading into a spacious dining area with a wood-burning stove that seamlessly connects to an extended, modern kitchen and breakfast room, alongside a practical utility and separate shower room.\n\nUpstairs, the bright theme continues across three comfortable bedrooms and a family bathroom with a separate WC. Adding to the home's practical appeal is a vast attic space accessed via a Stira ladder, designed for an exceptionally straightforward conversion to yield considerable additional living space down the line.\n\nThe exterior of the property is just as impressive, featuring meticulously landscaped gardens that soak up all-day sunshine courtesy of the property's south-facing orientation. A convenient gated side entrance provides secure, direct access to the rear garden, creating a private outdoor sanctuary perfect for entertaining and relaxation.\n\nSituated in an unbeatable location, the property sits within easy reach of Milltown Village, Dundrum Village, and the world-class shopping and dining at Dundrum Town Centre. Excellent public transport links surround the home, with the Luas Green Line just a short stroll away at Windy Arbour and Dundrum, offering effortless access to the city centre. University College Dublin (UCD) and its extensive sports and leisure facilities are also right on your doorstep, alongside a fantastic choice of premier primary and secondary schools."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 4.6m x 1.85m\nBright and inviting entrance hall with hardwood floors, stairs to first floor level, understairs storage and accommodation off.\n\nGuest Cloak Room - 2.25m x 1.85m (furthest points\nWith shower, toilet and wash hand basin. Tiled floor.\n\nLiving Room - 3.7m x 3.6m\nFront facing reception room with a bay window, Tongue & Groove hardwood floors, picture rail and tiled mantle.\n\nDining Room - 3.7m x 3.55m\nWood burning stove, laminate floors and opening to the breakfast room and kitchen.\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Room - 5.2m x 3m\nOverlooking the rear garden and with doors leading to same. Twin Velux roof windows soaking the area in natural light. Floor and eye level, cream fitted units, tiled floor and splashback and appliances included.\n\nUtility Room - 1.85m x 1m\nWith washing machine and Ideal Gas boiler. Tiled floor. Fitted units.\n\nGuest Cloak Room - 2.25m x 1.85m (furthest points)\nShower, toilet and wash hand basin. Tiled floor.\n\nLanding - 2.4m x 2.1m (furthest points)\nWith accommodation and bathroom off. Newly installed Stira leading to a large attic, easily convertible.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 2.95m\nFront facing double bedroom with T&G floors, bay window and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m x 3.4m\nRear facing double bedroom with T&G floors and fitted wardrobes. Picture rail.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.65m x 2.65m\nFront facing single bedroom with built in storage.\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 2m\nBath with shower over. Sink. Part tiled. Separate wc.\n\nOutside - \nCobble-blocked driveway with off street parking for two cars. Gated side entrance leading to a south facing, landscaped rear garden with paved suntraps, feature lawns, plants and shrubs.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Choice location close to all amenities</li><li> Luas & schools nearby</li><li> Off street parking</li><li> South facing</li><li> Double Glazed windows</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Large, convertible attic</ul>"
      },
